  {%- comment -%}
    These were `| script_tag`, which emits a plain blocking script element
    with no defer attribute. Nine of them executed serially and blocked
    DOMContentLoaded, delaying every observer and listener on the page.
    `defer` preserves execution order exactly but lets parsing finish first.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <script src="{{ 'beyond-the-test-preloader.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
  <script src="{{ 'beyond-the-test-industries.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
